@startuml
[*] --> DRAFT : authorized analyst / AI prepares draft
DRAFT --> ANALYSIS_RUNNING : attach owned running job
ANALYSIS_RUNNING --> DRAFT : terminal job
DRAFT --> READY_FOR_REVIEW : analyst submits complete revision
READY_FOR_REVIEW --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : reviewer requests changes / rejects
CHANGES_REQUESTED --> DRAFT : analyst creates new revision
READY_FOR_REVIEW --> APPROVED : independent assigned human\nchecks + comments + exact hash
APPROVED --> PUBLISHED : explicit assigned publisher\nDEVELOPMENT_SIMULATION only today
APPROVED --> DRAFT : new revision
PUBLISHED --> DRAFT : new revision; prior published snapshot retained
note right of PUBLISHED
Only entitled client sees released snapshot.
AI cannot approve or publish.
No scientific-method validation claim.
end note
@enduml
